<title>DUBAI: Oman tenders to buy leaded gasoline.</title>
<headline>Oman tenders to buy leaded gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman Refining Company has issued a tender to buy up 45,000 tonnes of 97-ron leaded gasoline for first-half May delivery, Omani and trade sources said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The tender, for the supply of a 25,000 tonne cargo on May 5 and a 20,000 tonne cargo on May 12, closes on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender was to allow the company to build up domestic inventories after recent maintenance work at the Mina al-Fahal plant had reduced stock levels, a source said.</p>
